WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.368
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:04.103
This is "Late Night."
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.504
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:06.573
That's great to hear.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.107
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:11.478
The White House is reportedly
considering major changes

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:13.045
for its communications team.

00:00:13.045 --> 00:00:15.281
For example,
they're going to get one.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:17.182
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:20.586
The National Archives yesterday
asked the Secret Service

00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:22.722
to provide information
about the deletion

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:24.357
of agents' text messages

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.191
pertaining
to the Capitol attack.

00:00:26.191 --> 00:00:27.460
Who's laughing now...

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.329
said the one agent
with an Android

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:30.930
who wasn't allowed
in the group chat.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.698
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:35.634
Britain's Prince William
and Duchess Kate Middleton

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:36.836
announced today

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:38.671
that they will travel to Boston
later this year.

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:41.941
This news was first reported
by Paul Revere.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:45.345
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:47.046
Former New York mayor
Bill de Blasio

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:49.582
announced yesterday he's ending
his congressional campaign,

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.151
and I'm guessing this is
not how Bill de Blasio

00:00:52.151 --> 00:00:56.022
wanted everyone to learn
he had a congressional campaign.

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:57.957
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:00.427
Today was
National Pennsylvania Day.

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:03.696
"Where the hell is that?"
asked Dr. Oz.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.765
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:09.101
According to a new list, Vermont
is the best state to live in.

00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:11.738
Well, no wonder.
He always looks so happy.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.339
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:14.841
Netflix reported yesterday

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:17.276
that it lost nearly
1 million subscribers

00:01:17.276 --> 00:01:18.745
in the last three months.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:21.714
Well, Netflix, I think you
finally have your answer.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.916
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:26.385
Two governing bodies
of quidditch have announced

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:29.255
that they will change the name
of the sport to quadball

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:31.991
in an effort to distance
themselves from J.K. Rowling.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.526
Said bullies, "Fine,

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:36.562
let's go beat up
the quadball players, then!"

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:37.664
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:40.166
When asked about his song
"American Pie"

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:42.335
in a new documentary,
singer Don McLean

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:46.038
said the jester mentioned in
the lyrics is not James Dean.

00:01:46.038 --> 00:01:47.873
He also said, "Please,

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:50.109
please don't sing that song
at karaoke."

00:01:50.109 --> 00:01:51.377
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.712
And finally,
after a man recently fell

00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:55.648
and injured himself
at Lake Tahoe,

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.283
his border collie ran 200 yards

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.385
through the remote area
of the forest

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:01.421
to lead rescue crews
to his owner,

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:05.158
while his French bulldog ran
six feet and immediately died.

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:07.326
And that --
You end on an up.

00:02:07.326 --> 00:02:09.361
You end the monologue on an up.

00:02:09.361 --> 00:02:11.397
That was the monologue,
everybody!

